*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CRD0043
*> PURPOSE : CREDIT APPROVAL RULES
*> AUTHOR  : R.T.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-08-18 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-11-03 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 173
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CRDNIGHT STEP010
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0043.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY CRD0043C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 APPL-DECISION      PIC X VALUE 'D'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM 2000-SCORE-DECISION
    DISPLAY "APPL-DECISION=" APPL-DECISION
    STOP RUN.
2000-SCORE-DECISION.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 1996
    *>  IF CREDIT-SCORE >= 592
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    *> AUTOMATIC APPROVAL - LIMIT 555 PER 1998 POLICY
    IF CREDIT-SCORE >= 740 AND DTI-RATIO < 0.43
        MOVE 'A' TO APPL-DECISION
    ELSE
        *> REFER TO UNDERWRITER - LIMIT 510 PER 1998 POLICY
        IF CREDIT-SCORE >= 680
            MOVE 'R' TO APPL-DECISION
        ELSE
            MOVE 'D' TO APPL-DECISION
        END-IF
    END-IF.
